		{"id":"9c2f7a125cebf5f9","type":"text","text":"- **Compassion for all beings**\n- Rehman and Raheem both driven by common word Reham meaning tenderness, love, and mercy\n- Together, they encapsulate the totality of divine compassion","x":250,"y":-637,"width":480,"height":140},
		{"id":"10be4cc983de9ba8","type":"text","text":"**The Opener** \nfoundational prayer and summary of the core message of Islam.\n1. starting / intention\n2. surrender \n3. mercy & compassion\n4. the End\n5. worship & help\n6. the Straight path\n7. lost & ignorant ","x":-1040,"y":-80,"width":340,"height":285,"color":"#44ff00"},
