		{"id":"03c616ae4b8a2d72","type":"text","text":"- **The Opening of opening** \n- The only Surah counts Bismillah as its Ayah\n- What is the link between intention and this ayah?\n- Intention first, action second\n- Al Rehman & Al Rahim\n- Try not to do things you cannot start with Bismillah","x":250,"y":-1172,"width":480,"height":175},
