		{"id":"cff4b6b258484155","type":"text","text":"- **Nobody other than Allah worthy to be Worship or ask for help** \n- Nobody other than Allah powerful enough to be afraid off\n- A strong believer only rely on Allah for everything","x":-2560,"y":-660,"width":500,"height":160},
		{"id":"bc0fa6394453cf65","type":"text","text":"- **Seeking guidance to the Straight Path**\n- You need him to be on the straight path\n- clear, balanced life, worshiping God, divine guidance, moral righteousness.\n- Seeking and supporting truth ","x":-2560,"y":-910,"width":500,"height":154}
